<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>夸克創意 QoooQ CREATIVE | 森下仁丹 短影音流量操作策略</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;700&family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;700&display=swap');

        :root {
            --gold: #B8892A;
            --gold-light: #D4A84B;
            --cream: #FAF6EF;
            --warm-white: #FFFDF9;
            --brown-deep: #3B2A14;
            --brown-mid: #6B4C28;
            --brown-light: #C4A882;
            --text-main: #2E1F0E;
            --text-muted: #7A6248;
            --border: #E0CDB0;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--cream);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 48px 24px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .container {
            background-color: var(--warm-white);
            max-width: 860px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* ── HEADER ── */
        .header {
            background-color: var(--brown-deep);
            padding: 44px 60px 36px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .header::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold) 0%, var(--gold-light) 50%, transparent 100%);
            margin-top: 28px;
        }
        .header-eyebrow {
            font-size: 0.7em;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            color: var(--brown-light);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
            font-size: 1.75em;
            color: var(--warm-white);
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .header-sub {
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        /* ── BODY ── */
        .body {
            padding: 48px 60px;
        }

        /* ── SECTION ── */
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 52px;
        }
        .section-label {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.65em;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--gold);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold-light);
            padding-bottom: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .section h2 {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            color: var(--brown-deep);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .section p strong { color: var(--brown-deep); }
        .section p {
            font-size: 0.92em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        /* ── NOTICE BOX ── */
        .notice {
            background-color: #FBF5E8;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
            padding: 18px 22px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        .notice p {
            font-size: 0.88em;
            color: var(--brown-mid);
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }
        .notice strong { color: var(--brown-deep); }

        /* ── SERVICE CARDS ── */
        .service-grid {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .service-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .card-header {
            background-color: var(--brown-deep);
            padding: 14px 22px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            gap: 14px;
        }
        .card-num {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            min-width: 24px;
        }
        .card-title {
            font-size: 0.95em;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--warm-white);
            letter-spacing: 0.03em;
        }
        .card-price {
            margin-left: auto;
            font-size: 0.82em;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .card-body {
            padding: 18px 22px;
            background-color: var(--warm-white);
        }
        .card-body ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .card-body ul li {
            font-size: 0.88em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 5px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border);
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .card-body ul li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .card-body ul li::before {
            content: '—';
            color: var(--brown-light);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .card-body .note {
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            color: var(--brown-light);
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .card-body li strong { color: var(--brown-deep); }
        .card-sub {
            font-size: 0.78em;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin: 22px 0 6px;
        }
        .card-sub:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
        .card-body .notice { margin: 14px 0 0; }

        /* ── PRICE TABLE ── */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        thead tr {
            background-color: var(--brown-deep);
        }
        th {
            padding: 11px 16px;
            font-size: 0.78em;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            text-align: left;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        td {
            padding: 11px 16px;
            font-size: 0.88em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
        tr:nth-child(even) td { background-color: #FBF8F2; }
        td strong { color: var(--brown-deep); }


        /* ── DARK BAND ── */
        .band {
            background-color: var(--brown-deep);
            margin: -48px -60px 52px;
            padding: 48px 60px 44px;
            color: var(--warm-white);
        }
        .band .section-label { color: var(--gold-light); border-color: var(--gold); }
        .band h2 { color: var(--warm-white); }
        .band .lead { color: var(--brown-light); font-size: 0.92em; margin-bottom: 26px; }

        .law-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 14px;
        }
        .law {
            background: rgba(255, 253, 249, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 168, 75, 0.25);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 18px 20px;
        }
        .law-num {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            font-size: 0.95em;
        }
        .law-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1em;
            color: var(--warm-white);
            margin: 4px 0 6px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .law-desc { font-size: 0.82em; color: var(--brown-light); line-height: 1.75; }

        
        .band { margin-top: -48px; }
        .band .lead { margin-bottom: 22px; }

        /* dual-track diagram */
        .flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 40px 1fr; gap: 0; align-items: center; }
        .flow-src { background: var(--gold-light); color: var(--brown-deep); border-radius: 4px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .flow-src b { display: block; font-size: 1.05em; }
        .flow-src span { font-size: 0.8em; }
        .flow-arrow { text-align: center; color: var(--gold-light); font-size: 1.4em; }
        .flow-outs { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
        .flow-out { border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,75,.35); background: rgba(255,253,249,.06); border-radius: 4px; padding: 12px 16px; }
        .flow-out b { color: var(--warm-white); font-size: 0.92em; }
        .flow-out p { color: var(--brown-light); font-size: 0.8em; margin: 2px 0 0; line-height: 1.6; }
        .formula { margin-top: 22px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-size: 1.25em; color: var(--warm-white); letter-spacing: .05em; }
        .formula em { font-style: normal; color: var(--gold-light); }
        .formula-sub { text-align: center; font-size: .78em; color: var(--brown-light); margin-top: 2px; }

        /* formula cards */
        .grid4 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
        .fcard { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 18px 20px; background: var(--warm-white); border-top: 3px solid var(--gold); }
        .fcard .n { font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif; color: var(--gold); }
        .fcard h3 { font-size: 1em; color: var(--brown-deep); margin: 2px 0 4px; }
        .fcard p { font-size: .82em !important; margin: 0 !important; line-height: 1.75; }

        /* account timeline */
        .acct { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-top: 3px solid var(--gold); margin-bottom: 22px; }
        .acct > div { padding: 16px 18px 0 0; position: relative; }
        .acct > div::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 0; width: 15px; height: 15px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--warm-white); border: 3px solid var(--gold); }
        .acct > div.alert::before { border-color: #B5523B; background: #B5523B; }
        .acct .when { font-size: .72em; letter-spacing: .15em; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 6px; }
        .acct .alert .when { color: #B5523B; }
        .acct h3 { font-size: .98em; color: var(--brown-deep); margin: 2px 0 4px; }
        .acct p { font-size: .82em !important; margin: 0 !important; line-height: 1.75; }

        /* platform */
        .plat { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
        .pcard { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px 18px; }
        .pcard .name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--brown-deep); }
        .pcard .lvl { font-size: .75em; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; margin: 2px 0 6px; }
        .lvl.hi { color: var(--gold); } .lvl.mid { color: var(--text-muted); }
        .meter { height: 6px; background: #EFE5D3; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .meter i { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--gold); border-radius: 3px; }
        .pcard p { font-size: .8em !important; margin: 0 !important; line-height: 1.7; }
        .tbd { margin-top: 14px; border: 1px dashed var(--brown-light); border-radius: 4px; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: .85em; color: var(--brown-light); text-align: center; }

        /* charts */
        .chart-box { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 18px 18px 8px; background: var(--warm-white); margin-bottom: 14px; position: relative; }
        .chart-title { font-weight: 700; color: var(--brown-deep); font-size: .95em; }
        .chart-sub { font-size: .75em; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .legend { display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: .75em; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
        .legend i { width: 18px; height: 0; border-top: 2.5px solid #C08A1E; display: inline-block; }
        .legend i.ref { border-top: 2px dashed #9C8670; }
        .chart { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
        .chart .ax { font-size: 11px; fill: #9C8670; font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; }
        .chart .val { font-size: 12px; fill: #2E1F0E; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; }
        .chart .lab { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; }
        .chart .band-l { font-size: 11px; fill: #7A6248; font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; }
        .chart .hov { cursor: default; }
        .chart g.hov:hover path { opacity: .85; }
        .tip { position: absolute; pointer-events: none; background: var(--brown-deep); color: var(--warm-white); font-size: .75em; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 3px; white-space: nowrap; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .12s; z-index: 5; }
        details.tbl { font-size: .78em; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 4px 0 6px; }
        details.tbl summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--gold); }
        details.tbl table { margin-top: 6px; }
        details.tbl td, details.tbl th { padding: 6px 10px; }
        .obs { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 6px 0 0; }
        .obs li { font-size: .88em; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 8px 0 8px 22px; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border); position: relative; }
        .obs li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .obs li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: 17px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gold); }
        .obs li.down::before { background: #B5523B; }
        .obs strong { color: var(--brown-deep); }
        .ask { margin-top: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--gold-light); background: #FBF5E8; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px 20px; }
        .ask .k { font-size: .7em; letter-spacing: .2em; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
        .ask p { margin: 4px 0 0 !important; font-size: .88em !important; color: var(--brown-mid) !important; }

        /* proposals */
        .prop { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .prop-h { background: var(--brown-deep); padding: 14px 22px; display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .prop-h .tag { font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif; color: var(--gold-light); }
        .prop-h .t { color: var(--warm-white); font-weight: 700; }
        .prop-h .badge { margin-left: auto; font-size: .78em; color: var(--brown-deep); background: var(--gold-light); padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
        .prop-b { padding: 18px 22px; }
        .kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .kpi { background: #FBF5E8; border-radius: 4px; padding: 12px; text-align: center; }
        .kpi .v { font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1.2; }
        .kpi .v small { font-size: .5em; }
        .kpi .l { font-size: .72em; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .prop-b ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
        .prop-b li { font-size: .88em; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 6px 0 6px 18px; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border); position: relative; }
        .prop-b li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .prop-b li::before { content: '—'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--brown-light); }
        .prop-b li strong { color: var(--brown-deep); }
        .guarantee { margin-top: 14px; border-left: 4px solid var(--gold); background: #FBF5E8; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: .86em; color: var(--brown-mid); }
        .guarantee strong { color: var(--brown-deep); }
        .quote { font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-size: 1.02em; color: var(--brown-deep); border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); padding: 6px 0 6px 16px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
        .quote small { display: block; font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; font-size: .72em; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; }
/* ── DIVIDER ── */
        .divider {
            border: none;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            margin: 0 0 40px 0;
        }

        /* ── FOOTER ── */
        .footer {
            background-color: var(--brown-deep);
            padding: 28px 60px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .footer-brand {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
            color: var(--warm-white);
            font-size: 0.95em;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .footer-tagline {
            font-size: 0.75em;
            color: var(--brown-light);
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        }
        .footer-contact {
            font-size: 0.78em;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            text-align: right;
        }

        
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .body, .header, .footer { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
            .band { margin-left: -24px; margin-right: -24px; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
            .footer { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
            .footer-contact { text-align: center; }
            th, td { padding: 9px 10px; }
            .flow { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .flow-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); }
            .grid4, .plat { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .acct { grid-template-columns: 1fr; border-top: none; border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); padding-left: 18px; }
            .acct > div { padding: 0 0 16px; }
            .acct > div::before { top: 4px; left: -28px; }
            .acct .when { margin-top: 0; }
            .kpis { gap: 6px; }
            .kpi .v { font-size: 1.15em; }
            .chart-box { padding: 14px 10px 6px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-eyebrow">Strategy Proposal · 流量操作策略提案</div>
        <h1>夸克創意 QoooQ CREATIVE<br>森下仁丹 短影音／Threads<br>流量操作策略提案</h1>
        <div class="header-sub">自然流量 × 廣告素材 雙軌操作</div>
    </div>

    <div class="body">

        <!-- 一、操作模式 -->
        <div class="band">
            <div class="section-label">Model</div>
            <h2>一、我們的操作模式</h2>
            <p class="lead">以短影音與 Threads 做自然流量，同一批內容同時作為廣告素材投放，一次製作、兩種效益。</p>
            <div class="flow">
                <div class="flow-src"><b>短影音／Threads 內容</b><span>企劃 → 拍攝 → 剪輯</span></div>
                <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
                <div class="flow-outs">
                    <div class="flow-out"><b>自然流量</b><p>素人帳號多平台投稿，創造真實觸及、分享與討論度</p></div>
                    <div class="flow-out"><b>廣告素材</b><p>表現好的內容直接作為廣告素材投放，優化 CPO</p></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="formula">自然流量 ＝ <em>內容</em> × <em>帳號</em></div>
            <div class="formula-sub">兩者缺一不可，以下分別說明</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 二、內容 -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-label">Content</div>
            <h2>二、內容：現階段的爆款公式</h2>
            <p>經過一年的實際操作與數據累積，我們整理出目前最有效的內容方向：</p>
            <div class="grid4">
                <div class="fcard"><span class="n">01</span><h3>超口語化表現</h3><p>像朋友聊天一樣講話，降低距離感，讓觀眾願意停下來看完。</p></div>
                <div class="fcard"><span class="n">02</span><h3>少講商品專業介紹</h3><p>不能像 CM，避免明顯廣告感；觀眾一察覺是業配就會滑走。</p></div>
                <div class="fcard"><span class="n">03</span><h3>強烈的 BA 與 CTA</h3><p>使用前後對比（Before / After）清楚有感，結尾明確告訴觀眾下一步。</p></div>
                <div class="fcard"><span class="n">04</span><h3>有趣的訴求切點與故事</h3><p>用生活情境與故事帶出產品，讓內容本身就值得看、值得分享。</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider">

        <!-- 三、帳號 -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-label">Accounts</div>
            <h2>三、帳號：現況與規劃</h2>
            <p>帳號健康度直接影響自然流量。以下是我們帳號經營的實際狀況：</p>
            <div class="acct">
                <div class="alert"><div class="when">2026 年 2–3 月</div><h3>優質帳號無預警被 BAN</h3><p>經營近一年、表現最好的帳號遭平台無預警停權。</p></div>
                <div><div class="when">4 月起</div><h3>重新培養帳號</h3><p>帳號實質上從 4 月開始重新經營，目前流量與粉絲數仍在累積中。</p></div>
                <div><div class="when">接下來</div><h3>持續養號、提升健康度</h3><p>需要再花一段時間培養，讓帳號健康度與推播量回升。</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="notice">
                <p><strong>智科合作帳號狀況良好：</strong>先前配合的智科帳號都未受影響，流量一直維持不錯，破萬粉絲的帳號非常多。但因預算門檻，智科帳號目前只承接 <strong>20 萬以上預算的 TTO 案件</strong>，現有預算無法發案給他們，這部分相當可惜。</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider">

        <!-- 四、媒體 -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-label">Platforms</div>
            <h2>四、媒體：各平台表現</h2>
            <div class="plat">
                <div class="pcard"><div class="name">Instagram Reels</div><div class="lvl hi">流量最大宗</div><div class="meter"><i style="width:90%"></i></div><p>目前流量主要來源，爆款機率最高。</p></div>
